INSERT INTO `articles` VALUES (1,'Meta Ads yang Sehat: Mulai dari Pesan, Bukan dari Budget','Healthy Meta Ads: Start with the Message, Not the Budget','Kalau iklan kamu boros, sering kali masalahnya bukan di budget, tapi di ???pesan???. Saya biasanya mulai dari: siapa targetnya, masalah yang mereka rasakan, dan value yang paling gampang dipahami. Setelah itu baru rapihin struktur campaign dan lakukan testing kreatif. Kuncinya: 1 variabel diuji, 1 insight didapat, lalu iterasi pelan tapi pasti.','If your ads are wasteful, the problem is often not the budget, but the message. I usually start with three things: who the audience is, what problem they feel, and what value is easiest for them to understand. Only after that do I clean up the campaign structure and start creative testing. The rule is simple: test one variable, capture one insight, then iterate slowly but consistently.','uploads/1767160511_blog.webp','2025-12-29 18:00:51','meta-ads-yang-sehat','Kalau iklan kamu boros, sering kali masalahnya bukan di budget, tapi di ???pesan???.','If your ads are wasteful, the problem is often not the budget, but the message. I usually start with three things: who the audience is, what problem they fee...'),(2,'Landing Page yang Enak Dibaca (dan Bikin Orang Klik)','Landing Pages That Are Easy to Read (and Make People Click)','Landing page yang convert itu bukan yang paling rame, tapi yang paling jelas. Struktur yang saya suka: headline yang spesifik, benefit, proof sederhana, FAQ yang jawab keberatan, dan CTA yang kelihatan. Bonus: pastikan mobile-friendly dan loading cepat. Kalau user nyaman baca, peluang action naik.','A landing page that converts is not the noisiest one. It is the clearest one. The structure I like is simple: a specific headline, clear benefits, lightweight proof, an FAQ that answers objections, and a CTA that stands out. Bonus points if the page is mobile-friendly and loads fast. When users feel comfortable reading, the chance of action goes up.','uploads/1767160570_blog.webp','2025-12-29 18:00:51',NULL,NULL,'A landing page that converts is not the noisiest one. It is the clearest one. The structure I like is simple: a specific headline, clear benefits, lightweigh...'),(3,'SEO yang Masuk Akal: Niat User Dulu, Baru Keyword','SEO That Makes Sense: Start with User Intent, Then Keywords','SEO bukan soal ???masukin keyword sebanyak-banyaknya???. Saya fokus ke intent: user lagi cari apa, mau jawaban seperti apa, dan halaman mana yang paling relevan. Setelah itu rapihin struktur H1/H2, internal link, dan copy yang jelas. Targetnya traffic yang relevan, bukan sekadar ramai.','SEO is not about stuffing as many keywords as possible. I focus on intent first: what the user is looking for, what kind of answer they expect, and which page is most relevant to serve it. After that, I refine the H1/H2 structure, internal links, and the clarity of the copy. The goal is relevant traffic, not traffic for vanity.','uploads/1767160612_blog.jpeg','2025-12-29 18:00:51',NULL,NULL,'SEO is not about stuffing as many keywords as possible. I focus on intent first: what the user is looking for, what kind of answer they expect, and which pag...'),(4,'Content System Anti Monoton: Pilar Konten + Kalender','A Content System That Does Not Feel Repetitive: Content Pillars + Calendar','Kalau konten terasa monoton, biasanya karena pilar konten tidak jelas. Saya pakai pilar sederhana: edukasi, proof, promo, dan behind the scenes. Tinggal dibuat kalender mingguan yang realistis. Dengan sistem ini, produksi konten lebih gampang, brand voice lebih konsisten, dan ide tidak cepat habis.','When content feels repetitive, the issue is usually a weak pillar system. I use a simple structure: education, proof, promotion, and behind the scenes. Then I turn that into a realistic weekly calendar. With a system like this, content production becomes easier, brand voice stays more consistent, and ideas do not run dry too quickly.','uploads/1767160652_blog.jpg','2025-12-29 18:00:51',NULL,NULL,'When content feels repetitive, the issue is usually a weak pillar system. I use a simple structure: education, proof, promotion, and behind the scenes. Then...'),(5,'Copywriting Praktis: Hook - Benefit - Proof - CTA','Practical Copywriting: Hook - Benefit - Proof - CTA','Kalau bingung mulai dari mana, pakai pola ini: Hook yang relate, benefit yang spesifik, proof yang sederhana, lalu CTA yang jelas. Pola ini kepake buat iklan, landing page, maupun caption konten. Simple, tapi efektif buat bikin orang ???ngeh??? dan ambil action.','If you are not sure where to start, use this pattern: a relatable hook, a specific benefit, simple proof, and a clear CTA. This framework works for ads, landing pages, and social captions alike. It is simple, but it helps people understand the message faster and move toward action.','uploads/1767160723_blog.jpeg','2025-12-29 18:00:51',NULL,NULL,'If you are not sure where to start, use this pattern: a relatable hook, a specific benefit, simple proof, and a clear CTA. This framework works for ads, land...');
