INSERT INTO `experience` VALUES (4,'Digital Marketer dan Growth Engineer','Digital Marketer and Growth Engineer','PT Matik Creative Technology','Juni 2024 ??? Sekarang','June 2024 - Present','Membangun dan mengeksekusi strategi funnel dari awareness hingga konversi dengan pendekatan data-driven. Mengelola Paid Ads (Meta Ads dan Google Ads), membuat landing page kampanye, serta optimasi SEO/SEM hingga traffic organik naik sampai 40 persen. Menjalankan broadcast tersegmentasi dengan open rate di atas 35 persen, reporting via GA4 dan Meta Suite, serta A/B testing untuk peningkatan CTR. ','Built and executed data-driven funnel strategies from awareness to conversion. Managed Paid Ads (Meta Ads and Google Ads), created campaign landing pages, and optimized SEO/SEM until organic traffic grew by up to 40 percent. Also ran segmented broadcasts with open rates above 35 percent, reported through GA4 and Meta Suite, and executed A/B tests to improve CTR.'),(5,'E-Commerce Specialist','E-Commerce Specialist','Shopone Store','Jan 2023 ??? Mar 2024','Jan 2023 - Mar 2024','Mengelola operasional dan pemasaran e-commerce end-to-end, termasuk produksi, layanan pelanggan, distribusi, inventori, dan laporan keuangan. Mencapai 1.000+ produk terjual dalam 1 bulan pada kategori beauty care.','Managed end-to-end e-commerce operations and marketing, including production, customer service, distribution, inventory, and financial reporting. Reached more than 1,000 products sold in one month in the beauty care category.'),(6,'Admin Marketing','Marketing Admin','PT Swans','Juli 2022 ??? Des 2022','July 2022 - Dec 2022','Mengelola sosial media untuk promosi dan kampanye berbasis website, follow-up pelanggan hingga pembayaran, serta pembaruan stok berkala. Melakukan analisis traffic mingguan untuk evaluasi dan perbaikan campaign.','Managed social media for promotional and website-based campaigns, followed up customers through payment, and handled regular stock updates. Also reviewed weekly traffic performance for campaign evaluation and improvement.');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `experience` ENABLE KEYS */;
