INSERT INTO `projects` VALUES (1,'Paid Ads','Paid Ads','Google Ads ??? App Install | Matik Laundry','Google Ads - App Install | Matik Laundry','Matik Laundry','Campaign app install dengan tracking rapi dan optimasi CPI agar stabil.','App install campaign with clean tracking and stable CPI optimization.','Target install tinggi, budget terbatas, dan perlu kontrol kualitas akuisisi.','Install targets were high, the budget was limited, and acquisition quality needed tighter control.','Rancang struktur campaign, set UTM/measurement, optimasi keyword/asset, dan monitoring harian untuk efisiensi CPI.','Built the campaign structure, set up UTM and measurement, optimized keywords and assets, and monitored performance daily to keep CPI efficient.',NULL,NULL,'Fokus eksekusi: campaign structure, targeting, budget pacing, dan review performa harian. Output: install bertambah dengan CPI rendah untuk tahap awal akuisisi.','Execution focused on campaign structure, targeting, budget pacing, and daily performance review. The result was stronger install volume with a low CPI for the early acquisition stage.','{\"unit\":\"install\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Day 1\",\"value\":20},{\"label\":\"Day 2\",\"value\":22},{\"label\":\"Day 3\",\"value\":24},{\"label\":\"Day 4\",\"value\":26},{\"label\":\"Day 5\",\"value\":28},{\"label\":\"Day 6\",\"value\":20},{\"label\":\"Day 7\",\"value\":20}]}','{\"unit\":\"install\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Day 1\",\"value\":20},{\"label\":\"Day 2\",\"value\":22},{\"label\":\"Day 3\",\"value\":24},{\"label\":\"Day 4\",\"value\":26},{\"label\":\"Day 5\",\"value\":28},{\"label\":\"Day 6\",\"value\":20},{\"label\":\"Day 7\",\"value\":20}]}',NULL,'https://laundry.matik.id/','Google Ads, App Campaign, GA4, UTM','160 installs ??? CPI ~Rp937','160 installs - CPI ~Rp937',1,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'App install campaign with clean tracking and stable CPI optimization.'),(2,'Paid Ads','Paid Ads','Meta Ads ??? Engagement | IG/FB','Meta Ads - Engagement | IG/FB','Matik (Internal Brand)','Menaikkan engagement konten untuk awareness yang lebih ???hangat??? sebelum konversi.','Boosted content engagement to build warmer awareness before conversion.','Engagement rendah karena konten dan objective belum selaras.','Engagement stayed low because the content direction and campaign objective were not aligned.','Pilih objective engagement, sesuaikan creative/copy, refine audience, dan evaluasi biaya per interaksi.','Selected the right engagement objective, adjusted creative and copy, refined the audience, and reviewed the cost per interaction.',NULL,NULL,'Eksekusi berbasis testing kreatif dan pemilihan audience yang tepat. Hasil dibuat natural untuk portfolio dan bisa diganti angka real kapan saja.','Execution relied on creative testing and smarter audience selection. The numbers are presented as a portfolio-friendly draft and can be replaced with live campaign data at any time.','{\"unit\":\"interaction\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Week 1\",\"value\":8},{\"label\":\"Week 2\",\"value\":10},{\"label\":\"Week 3\",\"value\":12}]}','{\"unit\":\"interaction\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Week 1\",\"value\":8},{\"label\":\"Week 2\",\"value\":10},{\"label\":\"Week 3\",\"value\":12}]}',NULL,NULL,'Meta Ads Manager, IG/FB Placements, Creative Testing','30 interaksi ??? CPE ~Rp3.333','30 interactions - CPE ~Rp3,333',2,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Boosted content engagement to build warmer awareness before conversion.'),(3,'Paid Ads','Paid Ads','Meta Ads ??? Traffic to Instagram Profile','Meta Ads - Traffic to Instagram Profile','Matik (Internal Brand)','Traffic campaign untuk mendorong kunjungan profil IG dan memperkuat growth organik.','Traffic campaign to drive Instagram profile visits and support organic growth.','Traffic sering ???ngasal??? jika CTA dan landing (profil) tidak sinkron.','Traffic quality can become noisy when the CTA and the landing destination are not aligned.','Optimasi CTA & copy, sesuaikan creative dengan tampilan profil, dan evaluasi kualitas kunjungan (behaviour).','Optimized the CTA and copy, aligned creatives with the profile experience, and reviewed visitor quality based on behavior.',NULL,NULL,'Menaikkan kunjungan profil dengan pendekatan yang menjaga kualitas traffic. Cocok untuk tahap awareness dan follow-up konten organik.','This campaign increased profile visits with an approach that protected traffic quality. It fits the awareness stage and pairs well with organic content follow-up.','{\"unit\":\"profile_visit\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Mon\",\"value\":30},{\"label\":\"Tue\",\"value\":35},{\"label\":\"Wed\",\"value\":40},{\"label\":\"Thu\",\"value\":45},{\"label\":\"Fri\",\"value\":35},{\"label\":\"Sat\",\"value\":35},{\"label\":\"Sun\",\"value\":30}]}','{\"unit\":\"profile_visit\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Mon\",\"value\":30},{\"label\":\"Tue\",\"value\":35},{\"label\":\"Wed\",\"value\":40},{\"label\":\"Thu\",\"value\":45},{\"label\":\"Fri\",\"value\":35},{\"label\":\"Sat\",\"value\":35},{\"label\":\"Sun\",\"value\":30}]}',NULL,NULL,'Meta Ads, Traffic Objective, CTA, UTM','250 profile visits ??? CPV ~Rp600','250 profile visits - CPV ~Rp600',3,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Traffic campaign to drive Instagram profile visits and support organic growth.'),(4,'Sosial Media','Social Media','Social Media Management ??? Brand Digital & UMKM','Social Media Management - Digital Brands & MSMEs','Multi Brand','Mengelola konten IG/TikTok/Facebook: planning, caption, scheduling, engagement, dan evaluasi insight.','Managed Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook content planning, captions, scheduling, engagement, and insight evaluation.','Posting tidak konsisten dan arah konten belum selaras dengan tujuan bisnis.','Posting was inconsistent and the content direction was not yet aligned with business goals.','Buat content calendar 3???5 konten/minggu, caption SEO-friendly, SOP engagement, dan review insight mingguan.','Built a content calendar for 3-5 posts per week, wrote SEO-friendly captions, created engagement SOPs, and ran a weekly insight review.','','','Output yang ditonjolkan untuk HRD/client: konsistensi, kualitas komunikasi brand, dan evaluasi berbasis insight.','The main outcome highlighted for clients and recruiters is consistency, stronger brand communication quality, and insight-based evaluation.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767159013_proj.png','','Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, Canva, CapCut, Insights','+20???30% engagement','+20-30% engagement',4,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Managed Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook content planning, captions, scheduling, engagement, and insight evaluation.'),(5,'Website Development','Website Development','Company Profile ??? PT Hutama Solusi Indonesia','Company Profile - PT Hutama Solusi Indonesia','PT Hutama Solusi Indonesia','Company profile profesional: struktur jelas, UI rapi, mobile responsive, SEO basic-ready.','Professional company profile website with clear structure, polished UI, mobile responsiveness, and basic SEO readiness.','Kebutuhan website korporat yang kredibel dan mudah dipahami calon klien/mitra.','The company needed a credible corporate website that prospective clients and partners could understand quickly.','Bangun struktur informasi layanan, layout profesional, dan optimasi dasar performa + SEO.','Built a structured service architecture, a professional layout, and a solid baseline for performance and SEO.','test tantangan','test problem','Fokus: struktur informasi rapi, UI profesional, mobile responsive, dan SEO basic-ready. Case study di halaman detail menampilkan Tantangan/Solusi dan data pertumbuhan.','Focus: clear information architecture, professional UI, mobile responsiveness, and basic SEO readiness. The detail page case study includes the challenge, the solution, and growth data.','{\"labels\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\"],\"data\":[10,50,130,300],\"label\":\"Pertumbuhan revenue\"}','{\"labels\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\"],\"data\":[10,50,130,300],\"label\":\"Revenue Growth\"}','uploads/1767154203_proj.png','https://hutamasolusi.co.id/','WordPress/PHP, Responsive UI, Basic SEO','Corporate Website Live','Corporate Website Live',5,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Professional company profile website with clear structure, polished UI, mobile responsiveness, and basic SEO readiness.'),(6,'Website Development','Website Development','Company Profile ??? PT Mandiri Sentosa Sinergi','Company Profile - PT Mandiri Sentosa Sinergi','PT Mandiri Sentosa Sinergi','Website korporat yang clean untuk memperkuat trust dan memudahkan akses informasi layanan.','Clean corporate website designed to strengthen trust and make service information easier to access.','Konten korporat perlu disajikan ringkas namun meyakinkan.','Corporate content needed to be concise while still sounding convincing.','Susun arsitektur halaman, perapihan copy, dan layout yang nyaman dibaca HRD/klien.','Organized the page architecture, tightened the copy, and created a layout that feels easy for clients and HR teams to read.','','','Fokus: readability, struktur informasi, dan tampilan profesional. Hasil: website live dan siap untuk kebutuhan company profile.','Focus: readability, information structure, and a professional visual tone. Result: a live website ready to serve company profile needs.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154942_proj.png','https://mandirisentosa.co.id/','PHP, Tailwind, MySQL','Corporate Website Live','Corporate Website Live',6,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Clean corporate website designed to strengthen trust and make service information easier to access.'),(7,'Website Development','Website Development','Corporate Website ??? PT Matik Creative Technology','Corporate Website - PT Matik Creative Technology','PT Matik Creative Technology','Website utama brand untuk menjadi pusat informasi dan penghubung ke seluruh produk Matik.','Main brand website that serves as the information hub and connector for the full Matik product ecosystem.','Traffic dari campaign butuh ???hub??? yang jelas dan meyakinkan.','Campaign traffic needed a clear and convincing hub that could guide visitors to the right product.','Perkuat struktur konten, CTA, dan user flow ke produk (Laundry/POS/QPlus).','Strengthened the content structure, CTA placement, and user flow toward products such as Laundry, POS, and QPlus.','','','Website corporate sebagai hub brand: memperjelas value, layanan, dan jalur ke produk. Cocok untuk kebutuhan branding + conversion.','The corporate website acts as the brand hub, clarifying value propositions, services, and product pathways. It works well for both branding and conversion use cases.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155488_proj.png','https://matik.id/','HTML/CSS/JS, WordPress/PHP, CTA','Brand Hub Live','Brand Hub Live',7,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Main brand website that serves as the information hub and connector for the full Matik product ecosystem.'),(8,'Website Development','Website Development','Website Yayasan ??? Nurush Shodiqin','Foundation Website - Nurush Shodiqin','Yayasan Nurush Shodiqin','Website yayasan informatif untuk publik: profil, program, dan kegiatan.','Informational foundation website for the public, covering profile, programs, and activities.','Informasi kegiatan perlu disajikan sederhana dan mudah diakses.','Program and activity information needed to be simple and easy for visitors to access.','Bangun halaman yang ringan, struktur konten jelas, dan mudah dikelola.','Built lightweight pages, a clear content structure, and an easy-to-manage setup.','','','Website live dan siap untuk publikasi kegiatan yayasan.','The website is live and ready to support public publication of foundation activities.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154960_proj.png','https://yanus.id/','WordPress, Content Structure','Nonprofit Website Live','Nonprofit Website Live',8,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Informational foundation website for the public, covering profile, programs, and activities.'),(9,'Website Development','Website Development','Website Bisnis ??? Ozverlig Sportwear','Business Website - Ozverlig Sportwear','Ozverlig Sportwear','Website katalog & profil usaha konveksi jersey: fokus CTA pemesanan.','Catalog and business profile website for a jersey manufacturer, with a strong focus on order CTAs.','Calon pembeli sering datang dari IG???harus mobile-first dan cepat.','Many prospects arrived from Instagram, so the site needed to be mobile-first and fast.','Susun katalog, CTA WhatsApp, dan layout yang nyaman di mobile.','Structured the catalog, tightened the WhatsApp CTA, and built a mobile-friendly layout.','','','Hasil: katalog online yang rapi, CTA jelas, dan siap dipakai dari link bio.','Result: a neat online catalog with clear CTAs, ready to be used directly from a social bio link.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154299_proj.png','https://ozverligsportwear.com/','WordPress/WooCommerce, UI, CTA','Business Website Live','Business Website Live',9,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Catalog and business profile website for a jersey manufacturer, with a strong focus on order CTAs.'),(10,'Portal Berita/Artikel/SEO','News Portal / Articles / SEO','Portal Berita ??? Institut Kajian Strategi Nasional','News Portal - Institut Kajian Strategi Nasional','Institut KSN','Portal berita & profil institusi untuk publikasi artikel dan informasi organisasi.','News portal and institutional profile website for publishing articles and organizational information.','Kebutuhan struktur kategori + navigasi agar konten mudah ditemukan.','The portal needed a stronger category structure and navigation so visitors could find content more easily.','Merapikan struktur portal, kategori konten, dan tampilan yang kredibel.','Refined the portal structure, content taxonomy, and overall presentation to feel more credible.','','','Portal live dan siap publish konten rutin.','The portal is live and ready for ongoing content publication.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155045_proj.png','https://institutksn.id/tentang-kami/','WordPress, Custom Theme, SEO Basics','News Portal Live','News Portal Live',10,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'News portal and institutional profile website for publishing articles and organizational information.'),(11,'Portal Berita/Artikel/SEO','News Portal / Articles / SEO','Portal Berita Digital ??? PastiDigital','Digital News Portal - PastiDigital','PastiDigital','Portal berita digital dengan struktur SEO-friendly untuk scale konten.','Digital news portal with an SEO-friendly structure built to scale content production.','Konten banyak butuh struktur kategori + internal link yang rapi.','A growing content library needed cleaner categories and internal linking.','Optimasi struktur artikel, kategori, dan internal link dasar.','Optimized the article structure, content taxonomy, and foundational internal linking.','','','Portal live dan siap scale untuk SEO.','The portal is live and ready to scale for SEO.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155022_proj.png','https://pastidigital.com/','PHP Native, MySQL, SEO Structure','SEO-ready Portal','SEO-Ready Portal',11,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Digital news portal with an SEO-friendly structure built to scale content production.'),(12,'Website Development','Website Development','Landing Page ??? Matik Laundry (Primary)','Landing Page - Matik Laundry (Primary)','Matik Laundry','Landing page utama untuk campaign ads: value proposition jelas + CTA kuat.','Primary landing page for ad campaigns with a clear value proposition and strong CTAs.','Traffic ads butuh landing yang fokus konversi, bukan sekadar informatif.','Paid traffic needed a conversion-focused landing page instead of a purely informational one.','Susun benefit, social proof, FAQ, CTA, dan copy yang mudah dipahami owner laundry.','Structured the benefits, social proof, FAQ, CTA, and copy in a way laundry business owners can grasp quickly.','','','Landing page dibuat conversion-ready untuk mendukung Paid Ads dan follow-up tim CS.','The landing page was built to be conversion-ready and to support paid ads plus customer-service follow-up.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155137_proj.png','https://laundry.matik.id/','Landing Page, CRO, Copywriting, SEO Basics','CTA CTR +18% (dummy)','CTA CTR +18% (sample)',12,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Primary landing page for ad campaigns with a clear value proposition and strong CTAs.'),(13,'Website Development','Website Development','Landing Page ??? Matik Laundry (Variant)','Landing Page - Matik Laundry (Variant)','Matik Laundry','Variant landing untuk kebutuhan A/B testing dan segmentasi campaign.','Landing page variant built for A/B testing and segmented campaign messaging.','Butuh variasi pesan agar cocok untuk audiens berbeda.','Different audiences needed different message angles.','Siapkan struktur fleksibel untuk testing headline, benefit, dan CTA.','Prepared a flexible structure for testing headlines, benefit framing, and CTA variations.','','','Siap untuk A/B testing campaign.','Ready to support A/B testing in campaign execution.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154394_proj.png','https://matiklaundry.site/','Landing Page, A/B-ready','Variant for Testing','Variant for Testing',13,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Landing page variant built for A/B testing and segmented campaign messaging.'),(15,'Website Development','Website Development','Landing Page ??? Cafe & Resto System','Landing Page - Cafe & Resto System','Matik','Landing untuk segmen cafe/resto: menonjolkan operasional & efisiensi.','Landing page for the cafe and restaurant segment, emphasizing operations and efficiency.','Segmen berbeda butuh narasi dan benefit spesifik.','This segment required a more specific narrative and clearer benefit framing.','Susun copy khusus cafe/resto + CTA.','Wrote segment-specific copy and shaped the CTA around cafe and restaurant needs.','','','Segment-specific landing.','A landing page tailored to segment-specific messaging.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154450_proj.png','https://cafenresto.matik.id/','Landing Page, Segmentation, CTA','Segmented Landing','Segmented Landing',15,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Landing page for the cafe and restaurant segment, emphasizing operations and efficiency.'),(16,'Website Development','Website Development','Product Page ??? QPlus (Main)','Product Page - QPlus (Main)','QPlus (Matik)','Halaman produk untuk edukasi merchant + trust building.','Product page built to educate merchants and strengthen trust.','Merchant butuh trust + kejelasan benefit.','Merchants needed clearer benefits and stronger trust signals before taking action.','Perkuat copy, trust elements, dan CTA.','Improved the copy, trust elements, and CTA structure.','','','Merchant-ready product page.','A merchant-ready product page focused on education and credibility.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155204_proj.png','https://matik.id/qplus/','Copywriting, Trust Elements, CTA','Merchant-ready','Merchant-Ready',16,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Product page built to educate merchants and strengthen trust.'),(17,'Website Development','Website Development','Product Page ??? Fizzi Details','Product Page - Fizzi Details','Matik','Halaman detail produk: ringkas, jelas, dan mudah dipahami.','Product detail page that is concise, clear, and easy to understand.','Detail produk sering panjang dan membingungkan.','Long product explanations can overwhelm visitors.','Susun struktur yang fokus benefit + CTA.','Reworked the structure so the page focuses on benefits and a clear CTA.','','','Detail page yang lebih jelas dan elegan.','A cleaner and more elegant detail page.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154480_proj.png','https://matik.id/Fizzi-details.html','HTML, Content Structure, CTA','Clear Product Detail','Clear Product Detail',17,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Product detail page that is concise, clear, and easy to understand.'),(18,'Website Development','Website Development','Link Hub ??? link.matik.id','Link Hub - link.matik.id','Matik','Link hub untuk distribusi link campaign & bio social.','Link hub for campaign distribution and social bio traffic.','Link tersebar dan membuat user bingung.','Scattered links made the user journey confusing.','Bangun hierarki link + CTA, cocok untuk IG/TikTok bio.','Built a clearer link hierarchy and CTA flow tailored for Instagram and TikTok bios.','','','Meningkatkan keteraturan distribusi link campaign.','Improved the organization of campaign link distribution.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155448_proj.png','https://link.matik.id/','Microsite, UX, CTA','Campaign Link Hub','Campaign Link Hub',18,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Link hub for campaign distribution and social bio traffic.'),(19,'SaaS / PWA','SaaS / PWA','Microsite ??? Mager','Microsite - Mager','Matik','Microsite kampanye: cepat dibuat, fokus CTA.','Campaign microsite that is quick to launch and focused on CTA performance.','Kampanye butuh landing cepat dan ringan.','The campaign needed a fast, lightweight landing experience.','Susun copy singkat + CTA jelas.','Prepared short-form copy and a clear CTA structure.','','','Fast campaign landing.','A fast landing experience for campaigns.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154830_proj.png','https://matik.id/mager.html','HTML, Microsite, Performance','Fast Landing','Fast Landing',19,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Campaign microsite that is quick to launch and focused on CTA performance.'),(20,'Website Development','Website Development','Landing Page ??? QPlus (Variant)','Landing Page - QPlus (Variant)','QPlus (Matik)','Variant QPlus untuk campaign dan variasi pesan promosi.','QPlus landing page variant for campaign needs and alternate promotional messaging.','Butuh versi pesan berbeda untuk audiens berbeda.','Different audiences required different message angles.','Siapkan copy + CTA variasi untuk testing.','Prepared alternate copy and CTA variations for testing.','','','Variant siap campaign.','Campaign-ready variant page.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155409_proj.png','https://matik.id/qplus.html','HTML, Copywriting, CTA','Campaign Variant','Campaign Variant',20,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'QPlus landing page variant for campaign needs and alternate promotional messaging.'),(21,'Portal Berita/Artikel/SEO','News Portal / Articles / SEO','SEO Content & Website Optimization','SEO Content & Website Optimization','Matik (Internal)','Keyword research + SEO copywriting untuk menaikkan traffic organik dan kualitas kunjungan.','Keyword research and SEO copywriting to improve organic traffic and visitor quality.','Konten belum terarah ke search intent dan internal link belum rapi.','Content was not yet aligned with search intent and internal linking was still weak.','Riset keyword (Semrush), susun struktur artikel, internal linking, dan monitoring via GA4 + Search Console.','Ran keyword research with Semrush, structured the article architecture, improved internal linking, and monitored performance through GA4 and Search Console.',NULL,NULL,'Output: artikel yang ???people-first???, struktur heading rapi, dan strategi keyword jelas. (Angka growth dummy dan bisa diganti data real.)','The outcome is a people-first article structure, cleaner headings, and a clearer keyword strategy. Growth figures are sample numbers and can be replaced with live data.','{\"unit\":\"organic_traffic\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Month 1\",\"value\":100},{\"label\":\"Month 2\",\"value\":125},{\"label\":\"Month 3\",\"value\":140}]}','{\"unit\":\"organic_traffic\",\"series\":[{\"label\":\"Month 1\",\"value\":100},{\"label\":\"Month 2\",\"value\":125},{\"label\":\"Month 3\",\"value\":140}]}','','','Semrush, SEO Copywriting, GA4, Search Console','Organic +40% (dummy)','Organic +40% (sample)',21,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Keyword research and SEO copywriting to improve organic traffic and visitor quality.'),(22,'SaaS / PWA','SaaS / PWA','Lenbee ??? SaaS E-Course Platform','Lenbee - SaaS E-Course Platform','PastiDigital','SaaS e-course: manajemen course, user, dan flow pembelajaran.','SaaS e-course platform covering course management, users, and learning flow.','Butuh sistem pembelajaran yang terstruktur dan mudah dikelola.','The business needed a structured learning system that was easy to manage.','Bangun modul course & user, dashboard, dan struktur scalable.','Built course and user modules, a dashboard, and a scalable product structure.','','','Fokus: arsitektur fitur inti dan dashboard yang rapi untuk operasional e-course.','Focus: core feature architecture and a clean dashboard for day-to-day e-course operations.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767155224_proj.png','https://lenbee.pastidigital.com/','PHP, MySQL, SaaS, Dashboard','SaaS Platform Live','SaaS Platform Live',22,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'SaaS e-course platform covering course management, users, and learning flow.'),(23,'SaaS / PWA','SaaS / PWA','Dompetra ??? PWA Manajemen Keuangan','Dompetra - PWA Finance Management','PastiDigital','PWA finance: input cepat, ringkasan, dan mobile-first UX.','Finance PWA with fast input, concise summaries, and a mobile-first UX.','Pencatatan manual tidak konsisten dan sulit dimonitor.','Manual record-keeping was inconsistent and difficult to monitor.','Buat flow input sederhana, ringkasan, dan pengalaman mobile yang nyaman.','Created a simple input flow, clearer summaries, and a more comfortable mobile experience.','','','Aplikasi siap dipakai lintas device dan cocok untuk kebutuhan harian.','A cross-device app ready for daily financial tracking needs.',NULL,NULL,'uploads/1767154870_proj.png','https://dompetra.pastidigital.com/','PWA, JavaScript, Mobile-first','PWA Finance App','PWA Finance App',23,'2025-12-30 03:37:40',NULL,NULL,'Finance PWA with fast input, concise summaries, and a mobile-first UX.'),(24,'Website Development','Website Development','ApplyBot ??? PWA Lamaran Kerja via Email','ApplyBot - PWA Job Application via Email','PastiDigital','Automasi proses apply: data lamaran rapi + template email.','Automation tool for job applications, with structured applicant data and email templates.','Apply manual memakan wak